<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HLH SAYS CEO MORRIS RETIRING END-MARCH.</title>
<headline>HLH SAYS CEO MORRIS RETIRING END-MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company Hunt Leuchars and Hepburn Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that group chief executive Neil Morris had decied to take early retirement at the end of March 1997.</p>
<p>The move follows the completion of the sale of the group's timber interests and the recruitment of a new chief executive for the troubled Rainbow Chicken unit, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
